	(text "GPIO37 is fail-tolerant: divider 5.1k/7.5k gives 2.60-3.30V at VBUS 4.4-5.5V (1%).\nDisable GPIO37 internal pulls in firmware before testing VBUS.\nUSB differential route: nominal 90 ohm pair, short ESD path,\n27R series parts close to RP. PCB geometry is not designed yet.\nNo USB-to-battery path, no USB-powered standalone operating mode."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 231.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0ff966a6-8a0d-5b0f-b8b2-2360668a608a")
	)
	(text "USB VBUS is sensed only. It does not power or charge the battery.\nFirmware must gate USB attach on VBUS detection; SWD remains available.\nC5 USB pads are allocated to PARLIO; each C5 uses its UART header."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "38efe3dd-10a9-5a10-b5e4-5b8cef1d1aea")
	)
